// What the stock Xiaomi/Qualcomm telephony apps of OS3.0.8.0 need on an AOSP
// framework (proprietary-files.txt, IMS section), as LineageOS lineage-24.0
// (hardware/qcom-caf/common/qtitelephony-compat). The other piece, the
// TelephonyBaseUtilsStub boot jar, is in hardware/xiaomi/telephony: a boot jar
// must be in the root Soong namespace, which this tree is not.

// Declares the broadcasts QtiTelephony.apk sends as protected, as the
// Qualcomm framework does; Android reports a broadcast that a persistent
// system app sends without such a declaration (Log.wtf in system_server).
android_app {
    name: "QtiTelephonyCompat",
    manifest: "compat/AndroidManifest.xml",
    sdk_version: "current",
    system_ext_specific: true,
}
